  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "According to BODMAS rule\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nGiven equation 46 * 72 * 18 * 27 * 135 = 19\n\n**Option 1 :** Using the combination +, ÷, ×, -\n\n**46 + 72 ÷ 18 × 27 – 135 = 19**\n\n**By BODMAS rule**\n\n**46 + 4 × 27 – 135 = 19**\n\n**46 + 108 – 135 = 19**\n\n**154 – 135 = 19**\n\n**19 = 19**** (LHS = RHS)**\n\n**Option 2 : Using combination **-, ×, ÷, +\n\n46 - 72 × 18 ÷ 27 + 135 = 19\n\n46 - 72 × 0.67 + 135 = 19\n\n46 – 48.24 + 135 = 19\n\n181 – 48.24 = 19\n\n132.76 = 19** (LHS **≠** RHS)**\n\n**Option 3 :** Using the combination ×, ÷, -, +\n\n46 × 72 ÷ 18 - 27 + 135 = 19\n\n46 × 4 - 27 + 135 = 19\n\n184 - 27 + 135 = 19\n\n319 - 27 = 19\n\n292 = 19 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n**Option 4 :** Using the combination ÷, -, +, ×\n\n46 ÷ 72 - 18 + 27 × 135 = 19\n\n0.016 - 18 + 27 × 135 = 19\n\n0.016 - 18 + 3645 = 19\n\n3645.016 - 18 = 19\n\n3627.016 = 19 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, the answer is **“****+, ÷, ×, -****”****.**",
